==Strategy==
This stage can be easily rushed even with Satanmaria appearing more than once. [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat/Manic Lion Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] will help on rushing the stage. If you do not wish to rush, then any hard-hitting units can help since the enemies have a somewhat large amount of health, being at 75,000 for Super Devil and 90,000 for Satanmaria.

